</span>
</span>
</span>
<span data-status="safe" data-variant="success" class="badge h-6 w-fit shrink-0 gap-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full border px-2.5 text-xs whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-200 ease-[ease] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 [&amp;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 border-transparent bg-success-subtle text-success font-medium">
